      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Twilite Bootstrap Video\n\n## Goal\nShow a brand-new user how to open Twilite, copy the bootstrap handshake, teach the LLM the rules, paste back a valid mutation, and watch the graph update.\n\n## Target Length\n- Main cut: **4 to 6 minutes**\n- Short promo cut: **60 to 90 seconds**\n\n## Core Promise\nBy the end of this video, the viewer has completed one real graph mutation and understands that Twilite authoring is conversational, persistent, and graph-native.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "intro-videos-declaration"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "layout",
          "updatedAt": 1783742520090,
          "reason": "auto-layout"
        }
      }
