      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Audience And Promise\n\n## Audience\n- curious first-time Twilite users\n- LLM users who want something more structured than chat\n- technical creators who need a persistent idea surface\n\n## Promise To The Viewer\n- you will not learn every Twilite feature here\n- you *will* complete a real bootstrap flow\n- you will see the LLM return graph JSON instead of prose\n- you will know exactly where to go next",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "identity": {
