      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Shot List\n\n## 0:00 to 0:20 Cold Open\n- Twilite already open\n- quick cut: handshake copied\n- quick cut: JSON in LLM\n- quick cut: node appears in graph\n\n## 0:20 to 0:45 What Twilite Is\n- show the root graph briefly\n- mention persistent graph, not disposable chat\n\n## 0:45 to 1:15 Open The Bootstrap Lesson\n- navigate to `github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/bootstrap-llm/root.node`\n- pause on the lesson layout\n\n## 1:15 to 1:45 Copy The Handshake\n- highlight the address-bar handshake button\n- click it\n- show a small overlay that the bootstrap prompt was copied\n\n## 1:45 to 2:20 Paste Into The LLM\n- paste the handshake\n- ask for one small graph mutation\n\n## 2:20 to 3:00 Inspect The Response\n- highlight `action`, `commands`, `createNodes`, `type`, `label`, `position`, `data.markdown`\n\n## 3:00 to 3:30 Paste Back Into Twilite\n- apply the mutation\n- show the node appear\n\n## 3:30 to 4:15 Explain The Result\n- select the created node\n- show that it is now persistent graph content\n\n## 4:15 to 4:50 Teach The Habit\n- vague ask: `make it more colorful`\n- corrected ask: `add color to the graph nodes and edges`\n\n## 4:50 to 5:10 Point To The Next Tutorial\n- move to the primitives or getting started tutorial hub",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "intro-videos-declaration"
        },
