      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Screen Actions And Exact Captures\n\n## Graph Addresses To Show\n- `github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/bootstrap-llm/root.node`\n- `github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/basic-primitives/root.node`\n- `github://twilite-zone/public/tutorial/getting-started.document.node`\n\n## UI Elements To Highlight\n- address bar\n- `Copy bootstrap handshake` button\n- the returned JSON in the LLM\n- the point where the new node appears after paste\n\n## First Demo Prompt\n`Create one markdown node titled \"Hello Twilite\" with a short sentence in it.`\n\n## Second Demo Prompt\n`Create two markdown nodes and one reference edge between them.`\n\n## Visual Rule\nDo not flood the screen with raw onboarding text for too long. Show only enough of the handshake to prove that the prompt exists and is being pasted accurately.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
