        "markdown": "# Lower Thirds And Callouts\n\n- `Persistent graph, not disposable chat`\n- `Copy bootstrap handshake`\n- `Start with one small mutation`\n- `Return JSON only`\n- `Valid graph mutation`\n- `Inspectable, editable, connected`\n- `Refine the ask when it is vague`\n- `Next: declaration, port, portal, markdown`",
