      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Recording Notes\n\n## Performance\n- keep the tone calm and exact\n- avoid jargon stacking\n- do not explain everything at once\n\n## Editing\n- cut aggressively around paste operations\n- zoom in on the important part of the response, not the full wall of JSON\n- pause slightly when the node appears so the win registers\n\n## Safety\n- avoid showing private keys, account panels, or unrelated tabs\n- keep the demo graph tiny and obvious\n\n## Follow-up Videos This Can Lead Into\n- What is a node graph?\n- Basic primitives\n- Declaration tutorial\n- Bootstrap mistakes and how to correct them",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "intro-videos-declaration"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1784225889765,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
